<title>ROMANIA: Romania average one-week rate flat at 51 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania average one-week rate flat at 51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's central bank said the minimum permitted rate for its one-week refinancing funds stayed flat at 51 percent at Thursday's auction.</p>
<p>The central bank's offer went up slightly to 1.05 trillion lei from 1.01 trillion in a previous session.</p>
<p>($=3,687 lei)</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
